Collector: PSA's population history from PokemonPrice.com into card-data data/graded/psa_pop (pp_pop.py)

Brett, for the graded forecast's model: a new data folder for graded cards, with how many of each card and
grade were graded in every month back to 2017 (not for the website). Asked about the site's rules he chose
"Go ahead, personal use". pp_pop.py: the site's catalog once (its sitemap), then the pages on the list
card-data makes (the pages that may be his Card Ladder cards), one page every 4 seconds, set by set; a
refused request stops it for a day.

